{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "3a2a49341c3629c310de3980a5589ee789522b57bc0119cc1f52e8a2c55fbd2d", "ja": "瑞希？　それとも綾子？", "zh": "瑞希？还是绫子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5274e8e9cb242f6e6b843461bb3401802f8a30d05b9051205a8171b738b3b5d", "ja": "クライマックスシーンに挑むアイドル達。\nその迫真の演技は、まるで役の魂が乗り移っ\nたかのようだった。瑞希もまた、綾子の心に\n共鳴し、予想外の表情を見せる。すごい作品\nになると確信するプロデューサーであった。", "zh": "挑战高潮场景的偶像们。\n她们逼真的演技，简直就像被角色的灵魂附\n身了一样。瑞希也与绫子的内心产生共鸣，展\n现出了意料之外的表情。制作人确信这会成为\n一部了不起的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4462b0aec75d5ab9077d99060f73596290df57495a157e165e20f50eddf3dd17", "ja": "（撮影もいよいよ終盤。残るシーンもあとわずかだ。\n今日は……クライマックスのあの部分だ）", "zh": "（拍摄也终于接近尾声了。剩下的场景已经不多。今天……就是高潮部分的那一段了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "53589f0565b5ab1e273b91a040da8a98165574cd510d6b82da2081bc92e41d20", "ja": "（物語の重要なシーンだけに、現場には\n緊迫感が漂っている……みんな、頑張れよ！）", "zh": "（因为这是故事中的重要场景，现场弥漫着紧张感……大家，加油啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "ed421dca4e082fce96910f64d2767264e47a70df35f8f4055b0b0416871cffb0", "ja": "うっ、ぐうううっ……！", "zh": "呜，呜呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "01cc8a1dbd0f37c03e5da9d7e037be75d7912e4ad0413efd25425f2afd352003", "ja": "先生！\n華子、やめて！", "zh": "老师！华子，住手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "28f3d3936caf88bebd4e3bc7449ea1ff2ddc1ca6e72bac108d211f0d85594074", "ja": "私が止めるわ。\n綾子はその間に……。", "zh": "我来阻止她。\n绫子，趁这个时候……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "b8b9950d3739bc6f3536428f268f948af4fea8b7bc5c7b9edfe735cd5f3da4be", "ja": "邪魔だ！", "zh": "碍事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "9273cc8e5bfc2442002090bb9e52caa78bb548fd4cbc306111021259dbc8b5ca", "ja": "きゃああ！", "zh": "啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "85a111744ba266a6558bd7526061ac668a4ae14edcf2f146d2cc393b1e5ecdc7", "ja": "だめだよ、華子ちゃん！\nみんなにひどいことしないで！", "zh": "不行啊，华子！\n不要对大家做过分的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "9735385989835d27dea06ff81c09a2ea0b18a6572be2270ad75f58de37f65d1d", "ja": "放せ！", "zh": "放开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "53d2c972ced0858dac4159146b09d6176e18e3d4746691b4c2bd82e44cfc4e04", "ja": "いやっ、放さない！", "zh": "不要，我才不放！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "111f890b3f204f87eab4b7d931885f85839050bb3e3ebd2b1c5f03131815b556", "ja": "じゃあ、お前も死んじゃえ！", "zh": "那你也去死吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "2fa24bdc4a20bcec3aeaa425f3e05d1b9d04036ef7460a2d01f5e691d27f4c40", "ja": "ううっ……華子、ちゃん……！", "zh": "呜呜……华子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "07434e71ab839a0888671c17e30614353477ba37f38fdffd8d5e7f827590792e", "ja": "やめて華子！\n大切な友達でしょ！", "zh": "住手，华子！\n你们不是重要的朋友吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "79307af0ca6f8f89e7d082d96c937dfd4e6deae0559c305da58982023c11962d", "ja": "もうどうだっていい！\nわかばはお前を選んだ。わたしのものじゃない。", "zh": "已经无所谓了！\n若叶选了你。她已经不属于我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "7ab6689e54d0ca935e0cf4fa0b08edd50704d71eedf19618ff49d82f4c06a0be", "ja": "だからもう、いらない！\n全部壊してやる！", "zh": "所以已经不需要了！\n我要把一切都毁掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "47ef4ff8dc0172e4ac85b42041cfb154eada9b4049012f8c5bb1f3a484895f9c", "ja": "だめっ！", "zh": "不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "8f56738a90c5156079635096d44d8f8ac292bd65bd7c6c1cab1e11962a65ef03", "ja": "かはっ……はあ、はあ。\n呪いが弱まっているわ。今の内に儀式を。", "zh": "咳……哈啊，哈啊。\n诅咒变弱了。趁现在进行仪式吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "93527909150fc56cd61a8c713a4c0f9c42d322e086cad55f243d4b86ebe3789e", "ja": "ああ……いやだいやだいやだ！\nわかば、放して、放してよ！", "zh": "啊啊……不要不要不要！\n放开我，放开我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "62de88505651f14bdd7d781b024a00d1b82cd836b1efcaa1bbd48135b5399801", "ja": "ずっと、寂しかったんだね。\n気づいてあげられなくて、ごめんね……。", "zh": "你一直都很寂寞吧。\n对不起，没能察觉到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "d5cc6b84eaa39ca2cc55eb34b7a4bddc31314799fe82c2f6873ba87d4d730faa", "ja": "いまさらそんなこと言ったって、\nどうせわたしを祓うんでしょ。", "zh": "现在才说这种话，\n反正你也是要驱除我的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "42835066058677a2fffd0fc5c5cdeb1ee5af0916d1dc438c5713e84bef828c67", "ja": "安心して。私もついて行くから。\nこれからは、華子とずっと一緒だよ。", "zh": "放心吧。我也会跟着一起去的。\n从今往后，我会一直和华子在一起的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a5a587a63c839e97e9886fb29de7c806df64ee5bcc3384ead297e67699a26a89", "ja": "（あっ、瑞希の目から涙が……！）", "zh": "（啊，瑞希的眼睛里流出眼泪了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1023_kantoku", "source_sha256": "4e6f4127f5da50e31f9d08da5585a1c70f0da296ee3cec7c76b14cae9d582325", "ja": "カーット！　うーむ、これは……。", "zh": "咔——！嗯……这个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba12c73512fe78f600ecc1a94d984de62c9e4b70fcb496118418b6545ac51499", "ja": "ぐすっ……すみません、つい。\nもう一回、お願いします。", "zh": "抽泣……对不起，一不小心就……\n请再来一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1025_kantoku", "source_sha256": "96706a1db83419c74302219903ae8459e1e13a336dec2bfd7b97bcf2143b209a", "ja": "いや、オッケーだ！　今のテイクでいこう！", "zh": "不，没问题！就用刚才那一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "31e528ad9f35d12f740650ab639caa93cf65a02e6dac4e7df39b70b85203b797", "ja": "えっ。\n……いいんですか？", "zh": "诶。\n……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1027_kantoku", "source_sha256": "94ae889715e3532d002fa9122a700bef5231cf5463cc463cda43b23b7b167a08", "ja": "ああ！　今の表情のほうが絶対にいい！", "zh": "啊啊！还是刚才那种表情绝对更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1028_kantoku", "source_sha256": "8f50fa5b22007e8a88c419bc9982e9978c420dd5b6849161b44abc63c42cb130", "ja": "あ、涙は拭かないでね。メイクも直さなくていいから。\n気持ちが乗ってるうちに、次のシーン撮っちゃおう。", "zh": "啊，先别擦眼泪哦。妆也不用补。\n趁情绪还在，把下一个场景也拍了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "9e01730639b5aec6d3319ba1222a66e9e22c4e9a5b094fa3cc339304b31eb6e0", "ja": "わかりました。ありがとうございます。\n……OKをいただいてしまいました。", "zh": "明白了。谢谢您。\n……没想到能得到您的认可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "db21850523e9d53f232e83a732b331dae832446c66080383a5ac5aaf8564f01d", "ja": "実際にいい演技だったからな。\nシーンの流れとしても、ちゃんとハマっていたし。", "zh": "确实演得很棒嘛。\n而且顺应场景的衔接，也表现得很契合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "9f3b08c69822d046e54db2215b474dede107539dcda0a5e37ec668b97fd0fed1", "ja": "うん……桃子も、ビックリしちゃった。\nすごいね、瑞希さん。今の、アドリブ？", "zh": "嗯……桃子也吓了一跳呢。\n好厉害啊，瑞希小姐。刚才那是即兴发挥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "e737ff78a175911749c5767f8b9b20328e3c9e4b2077b06149ef73d5408a8973", "ja": "いえ、アドリブというわけでは……。", "zh": "不是的……也不是即兴发挥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "5cea9e1dbc34d4f734d5e0bcd892baa2e8f1f1ac5470cbe9dbcde44ad29f3b6e", "ja": "えっ、違うの？", "zh": "咦，不是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "994ee965529096c5065e1f6c6e75641a29c07e3ee0606f37abb5cc3a7f8a2641", "ja": "はい。あの時、周防さんから、華子の寂しさを感じて\n……気が付くと、涙が流れていました。", "zh": "是的。那时候，我从周防小姐身上感受到了华子的寂寞……回过神来，眼泪已经流下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "ffe5d9071149b274ce8efaf115dbc88e399019a93d0a974bf53f9a2a19f2ea9f", "ja": "完全に役に入り込んでたってことね。\n瑞希ちゃんだけど、綾子だった……。", "zh": "说明完全入戏了呢。\n虽然是瑞希，但当时就是绫子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "7bcc32385224143b2728e5eeab44f9b5bfefed66130e9fb16896a83e67e1be13", "ja": "まるで、綾子の魂が瑞希に乗り移ったかのようでした。\n役を生きるという事の、真髄を見た気がします。", "zh": "简直就像绫子的灵魂附身到了瑞希身上一样。\n我感觉自己看到了活出角色的真谛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "495d6c22d7a61568a3d9fbbe08150a2817a675dae9c031369fbcd30962705da1", "ja": "うん。役者として、一皮むけた、というところかな。", "zh": "嗯。作为演员来说，也算是突破了一层自我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "97bedf4bff18ad3f2b153dad133aa8959643c6e33c889c755a4fe83f1165a335", "ja": "ですが、まだ自分ではコントロールできないので……。\n次のシーンでも、綾子が来てくれるといいのですが。", "zh": "不过，我自己还无法控制……。\n要是下一个场景里，绫子也能来就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "0cbb6cceb42f653209556d98e2c52bbcf65343dd910d9356fa9da6666ec70d7b", "ja": "綾子じゃなくて、悪霊の方が乗り移っちゃったり？\n……なんてね、フフッ！", "zh": "该不会附身的不是绫子，而是恶灵吧？\n……开玩笑的，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "76fb671d3df1d6498d2c100dae9a8ba5a0ead4cdc0cd459655ad8c5f6629ec19", "ja": "その時は、私に塩をかけてお祓いしていただければと。\n……しゅわしゅわ～っと溶かしてください。", "zh": "到那时候，请往我身上撒盐驱邪。\n……请让我像起泡似的溶化掉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "da85c6e3990915f94ebac150c08e17b41293200914a7a3aab810153d006111f9", "ja": "瑞希さん、なんか、ナメクジみたい……。", "zh": "瑞希小姐，总觉得有点像蛞蝓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "44319e1f1818e618a37acc1e08c4c5eb335b6682eba413298b4d50d231400e3e", "ja": "もう……ふざけてないで、撮影に集中してよね。\nナメクジって……ふふっ。", "zh": "真是的……别闹了，专心拍摄啦。\n还蛞蝓呢……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "2b0e3147eea1bd30b408d8dc59b17076cef4f0d41917c7ec3e8a18341bba1d57", "ja": "（今回の撮影を通して、みんなの演技が\nレベルアップしているのを感じる……）", "zh": "（通过这次拍摄，我感觉大家的演技都有所提升……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_06_1044_p", "source_sha256": "c4cae0e849a0dc7bf3f628b9ae03550696615908401f36fed47d7aefadedc696", "ja": "（これは、すごい作品になるかもしれないな……\n映画の完成が楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（这说不定会成为一部很棒的作品……真期待电影完成啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
